      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture. The test class is a simplified excerpt from a larger test class, carrying lots of unused imports, fields, and helper methods. The actual test method is just 3 lines. I'll improve understandability by removing dead code, removing the magic numbers, and adding a clear Javadoc.Now I'll compile-check it.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed all unused imports, fields, and helper methods; replaced magic numbers `4` and `15` with named constants `OFFSET_AFTER_THE` and `LENGTH_OF_ANIMAL_JUMPS`; and added a Javadoc explaining why no substitution occurs."
